        <mxCell id="PzpG2bri5GxlcRA9Ap2d-91" parent="PzpG2bri5GxlcRA9Ap2d-87" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;This AuthService class acts as the service layer in the ATM application and handles business logic related to user accounts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Creates an object of &lt;code data-start=&quot;163&quot; data-end=&quot;175&quot;&gt;AccountDAO&lt;/code&gt; to interact with the database&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Provides methods for ATM operations:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Works as a bridge between:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Handler/API layer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;DAO/Database layer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Keeps the application structure clean using layered architecture&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="470" x="5" y="103" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
